<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smooth, polished</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσπη γλῶσσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					826
				</span></i>
			 codd.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσφος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λισπόπυγος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.184
			</span></i>; from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσπος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρίδιον λεπτὸν σφόδρα</span>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Callistr.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				848
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσπαι</span></b> , αἱ, <i>dice cut in two</i> by friends (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένοι</span>), each of whom kept half as a tally,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				193a
			</span></i>:—so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσποι</span></b> , οἱ, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
